# PancakeSwap Integration Guide

This guide explains how to integrate PancakeSwap yield farming and liquidity provision into your Lux multi-agent system.

## Overview

PancakeSwap integration enables agents to:
- Manage liquidity positions across multiple chains
- Automate yield farming strategies
- Implement auto-compounding mechanisms
- Track and optimize APY
- Monitor risks and positions

